    "text": "radionwtn.com\nwebsite\nCottage Grove\nCombine Heavily Damaged In Whitlock Fire\nBy Shannon McFarlin,\n11 hours agoWhitlock, Tenn.–A combine was heavily damaged in a fire Wednesday afternoon. The Cottage Grove Volunteer Fire Department was called to the middle of a field off of Whitlock Rd. around 4:15p.m. and found the combine “burning pretty good” upon their arrival, according to Fire Chief John Weiher.",
